  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The tech team would benefit from an AWS native Fedora instance built nightly from the main branch with S3 backing. It would likely use the default creds and would be wiped nightly but would b elf use to show the current build to each other and as a proof of s3 backend operations as not all committers have access to AWS. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
